<title>USA: ADM says to settle securities lawsuit.</title>
<headline>ADM says to settle securities lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>DECATUR, Ill. 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Archer Daniels Midland Co said it agreed to settle for $30 million a consolidated securities class action lawsuit filed against the company in the U.S. District Court for the Central District of Illinois.</p>
<p>Formal papers seeking court approval of the settlement are expected to be filed soon, the company said.  </p>
<p>The company said it reached the agreement to settle the lawsuit &quot;without admitting the alleged violations of law.&quot;</p>
<p>Further details of the settlement were not immediately available.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
